    "title": "¡Buenos Días!: Mexican-inspired breakfast joint opens in Clemson - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nathan Inman ,\n9 hours ago An Upstate-based breakfast restaurant has arrived in Tigertown. Buenos Días opened its doors in downtown Clemson on Tuesday, entering the city at the site of the former Palmetto’s Smokehouse and Oyster Bar next to TD’s of Clemson. The Mexican-inspired breakfast restaurant is locally owned with one other location in Anderson, South Carolina. Read full article",
